    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "But how would it even happen? I look at the heavy velvet curtains, or the bitter draughts in the cellar, and I just... I don't know. If I were to truly embrace this quiet you speak of, how would I even begin to step into it? It feels so far away, yet so inevitable.",
